   "k": "1ptpccj",
   "en": "Your best bet is probably to play non-historical and restart until ⟦0⟧ goes for its civil war. Forming ⟦1⟧ is critical before attacking ⟦2⟧, since you need more cores to build up a large enough army. If you want to make sure that ⟦3⟧, ⟦4⟧ or the ⟦5⟧ do not attack you, you could keep them at historical focuses. It could, however be beneficial to get a defensive war with ⟦6⟧ when it is time to expand.",
