  {
   "k": "18ytbb6",
   "en": "Manpower is the biggest issue in the beginning so it is recommended to play with ⟦0⟧ enabled so that ⟦1⟧ can be activated in the ⟦2⟧, which gives 500 weekly manpower. It is only available when ⟦3⟧, which is what you will be going anyway since you need ⟦4⟧ as your leader. Turning ⟦5⟧ is therefore your number one priority. Start with ⟦6⟧ and hire the ⟦7⟧. Work your way down to the 3rd Research Slot, then go for military factories. As for construction, start by building one ⟦8⟧, this will bypass the second Infrastructure focus, speeding up the process a bit. Then build maximum level land forts. You won't have any free slots for new factories yet. Get an Army Chief, and the ⟦9⟧.",
