   "en": "When you have turned ⟦0⟧, go for ⟦1⟧, which gives an additional 400 manpower weekly. Start building up an army. Aim for around 12 18 width infantry with engineering AA and artillery, but other setups also work. If you want, you can build a land warfare facility to add flamethrower tanks later on with a logistics company. Fight against ⟦2⟧, either by declaring war on ⟦3⟧ (if they exist, for lower World tension), or if they declare war on you. When they are defeated, declare war on the ⟦4⟧ via the ⟦5⟧, if possible.",
